}
```
Default colors per tool: lipstick Fresa index 2, eyeshadow Rosa index1, etc. Define DEFAULT_COLORS map:
```
lipstick:#d94862, gloss:#fff4ef, eyeshadow:#e8a6b4, eyeliner:#171317, mascara:#171317, blush:#f08a9a, highlighter:#fff0da, contour:#b98263, foundation:model.skin, freckles:#a56a45, eraser:#fff.
```
On select tool, check if current color is in that palette; if not use default. That way switching keeps if shared (black eyeliner to mascara). Good.
- When selecting a color, update current chip/name and swatch active.
- Add "selected" state for req chips.

Tool grid render:
```
function renderCategory() {
 toolTabs.innerHTML = TOOL_CATEGORIES.map...
 toolGrid innerHTML from category tools with ICONS.
}
