For eraser palette white show a trash? Maybe palette title "Borrador" and one swatch not useful. Hide palette panel? Still show one white circle. Could instead show note "El borrador elimina el maquillaje sin tocar la piel." We'll keep swatch but it's odd. Could hide swatches for eraser and show a text. In renderPalette, if tool==='eraser', show a .palette-note. Add CSS. Simpler show one "Borrador" swatch circle with x icon. Fine.
