```
function colorMatch(avg,target){
 const dr..., dg..., db...
 const dist=Math.sqrt(dr*dr+dg*dg+db*db);
 return clamp((165-dist)/120,0,1);
}
```
If avg=target dist 0 => clamp(1.375)=1. Dist 165 =>0. Different color e.g. red vs gold dist ~130 =>0.29. Fine. Use 160-110.
